> On Thu, Sep 25, 2025 at 3:14 PM Paul Wouters <paul.wouters=40aiven.io@dmarc.ietf.org> wrote:
>       Hi,
> 
> In general the document looks fine but I do find the Introduction and Security Considerations to have a lot of overlap in what they talk about.
> 
> I think that could be consolidated by moving and merging all but the last paragraph of the Security Considerations to Section 1, and leave the Security
> Considerations to talk about security considerations _when implementing this draft_ (I personally prefer the more detailed text in the Security Considerations
> over the Section 1 text describing the same issues but I'm fine with whatever works)
